WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.980
The first people.

00:01.670 --> 00:06.060
Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin stayed 21 hours and 36 minutes.

00:06.483 --> 00:13.148
Their whole walk covered about 250 metres, and neither went farther than about 50 m from the lander.

00:13.730 --> 00:16.049
Michael Collins waited for them in orbit.
